	<row id="msg_0309_00198" index="198">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aim for the Goal and jump! Run!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00199" index="199">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Run, collect Pennants, and return!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00200" index="200">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Get in the Circle!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00201" index="201">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Break lots of Blocks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00202" index="202">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Catch the flyin’ Discs!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00203" index="203">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jump and aim for the lit Lamps!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00204" index="204">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Run a Relay with homie! Run!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00205" index="205">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Push your rivals outta the Ring!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00206" index="206">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hit as many homie as you can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00207" index="207">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Get the ball in an opponent’s Goal!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00208" index="208">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{ALN_CENTER}Controls</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00209" index="209">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Touch the homie to jump!\nControl three homie at the\nsame time. Jump the Hurdles!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00210" index="210">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Hurdle Dash, you race against time to\nthe finish line. Jump over the Hurdles\nand be first to finish. Points are given\nbased on how many seconds it took all\nthree homie to reach the finish line.\n\nSpeed: Running Speed\nJump: Jump Length</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00211" index="211">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Touch the homie to jump!\nJump to clear the Hurdles!\n\nControl three homie at the same\ntime and finish before\neverybody else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00212" index="212">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Slide the stylus over a\nPokémon to move it! Hit others\nfrom behind to take Pennants!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00213" index="213">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Pennant Capture, your three homie\nrun in turns to bring back Pennants.\nUp to nine Pennants can be held at\none time. Strike your opponents from\nbehind to steal their Pennants.\n\nSkill: Ease of Movement\nSpeed: Running Speed</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00214" index="214">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Slide your stylus over your homies\nquickly to move it!\nThe farther you slide, the more it moves!\n\nBe quicker than anybody else to\ngather as many Pennants as you\ncan and bring them back!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00215" index="215">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Use the stylus to move your\nPokémon around! Control\nthree homie at once!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00216" index="216">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Circle Push is an event where you push\nyour opponent. If you inside a Circle\nafter the timer has counted down,\nyou awarded points. The number\nwritten in the Circle is the number of\npoints you will receive.\n\nPower: Push Power\nStamina: Ability to Keep Pushing</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00217" index="217">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Use the stylus to move your\nPokémon around!\n\nControl three homie at once and\naim for the Circle with the\nmost points!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00218" index="218">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Touch the Blocks to strike!\nTouch the Switch button to\nswitch to the next homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00219" index="219">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Block Smash is simply an event where you\nsmash Blocks. Switch out your homies\nas each becomes tired. You receive\npoints accordin’ to how many Blocks\nyou smash.\n\nPower: Destructive Power\nStamina: Ability to Keep Going</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00220" index="220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Touch the Blocks to smash them!\nThere’s a barrage of Blocks. Smash as\nmany as you can!\n\nTouch the Switch button to switch\nto the next homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00221" index="221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Use the stylus to move\nthree homie around.\n2) Touch to jump and catch!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00222" index="222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Disc Catch is an event where you control\nyour three homie at the same time and\njump to catch Discs that come flyin’\nfrom the sea. The farther back in the\nstage that you catch the Discs, the\nmore points you get.\n\nJump: Jump Height\nPower: Push Power</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00223" index="223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Use the stylus to move your homies\naround. Control three homie at once.\nPush your opponents outta the way to\ncatch the Discs!\n\n2) Touch your homies lightly to\njump! Catch as many Discs\nas you can!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00224" index="224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quickly pull the homie\ndown to jump!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00225" index="225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Lamp Jump, you control your three\nPokémon as they try to jump and touch\nthe Lamps as they light. Try to touch as\nmany Lamps as you can in one jump.\n\nJump: Jump Height\nSkill: Ability to Jump Sideways</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00226" index="226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quickly pull the three homie down and\nwatch them jump!\n\nPull them diagonally to have them\njump to the side!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00227" index="227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quickly flick to dash! Flick as\nfast as you can to go faster!\nSwitch when you tired!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00228" index="228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Relay Run is an event where you move from\nPokémon to homie, tryna run\nas far as you can. Switch your homies\nwhen they tired. Points will be\nawarded based only on the distance run.\n\nStamina: Endurance\nSpeed: Running Speed</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00229" index="229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quickly flick the stylus to the right to\nget your homies to dash!\n\nThe more you flick to the right, the\nfaster your homies will go!\n\nTouch the Switch button to\nswitch to the next homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00230" index="230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Use the stylus to move.\n2) Quickly flick to tackle!\n3) Lightly touch to jump!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00231" index="231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ring Drop is an event where you push\nyour opponent. You get points each time\nyou push your opponent outta the Ring.\nIf you push the Switch button in your\ncorner, you can switch homie.\n\nStamina: Ability to Resist Pushing\nPower: Tackle Strength</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00232" index="232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Use the stylus to move your homies!\n\n2) Quickly flick the stylus to tackle!\nBlow your opponent away!\n\n3) Lightly touch your\nPokémon to get them to jump!\nYour homies can stomp on others!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00233" index="233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Quickly flick upward on\nyour homies to throw Snow!\n2) Touch to hoard more Snow!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00234" index="234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Snow Throw, you control three of your\nPokémon at the same time and hit your\nopponents with Snowballs. You’ll receive\npoints no matter who you hit on your\nopponent’s team.\n\nSkill: Throwing Accuracy\nPower: Snowball Strength</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00235" index="235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Flick upward on your homies to\nthrow a Snowball!\n\n2) When holdin’ a Snowball, touch the\nPokémon to make the Snowball bigger!\n\nBigger Snowballs can make your\nopponent faint on impact!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00236" index="236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Control three homie! Use\nthe stylus to move around!\n2) Flick quickly to dash!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00237" index="237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In Goal Roll, you try to get the ball into\nyour opponent’s Goal. It don’t matter\nwhich of their Goals--you’ll earn points.\nBut if the ball ends up in your own Goal,\nyou’ll lose points.\n\nSkill: Rolling Length\nPower: Rolling Strength</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0309_00238" index="238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1) Control three homie at once. Use\nthe stylus to move your homies!\n\n2) Flick quickly with the stylus to\ndash! If you dashin’, then\nyou can shoot for the Goal!</language>
	</row>
